1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,204
Nice to meet you. I'm Harutora Kurobe.

2
00:00:03,204 --> 00:00:06,114
Sui Kishida, second-year student.
Nice to meet you.

3
00:00:06,114 --> 00:00:09,434
Sui's making a move on the newbie.

4
00:00:09,434 --> 00:00:11,984
You didn't know? This guy's gay.

5
00:00:11,984 --> 00:00:14,979
Does this mean you're into guys?

6
00:00:14,979 --> 00:00:16,390
[Sorry.]

7
00:00:17,844 --> 00:00:19,064
Welcome back.

8
00:00:19,064 --> 00:00:23,044
When I'm with you, I smile for real.

9
00:00:23,044 --> 00:00:27,424
Then can you take your mask off
when it's just us?

10
00:00:27,424 --> 00:00:29,194
Huh?

11
00:00:29,194 --> 00:00:31,024
Is that weird?

12
00:00:31,624 --> 00:00:33,344
It's not weird, but...

13
00:00:33,344 --> 00:00:35,194
Is that a no?

14
00:00:35,194 --> 00:00:37,604
I wouldn't say no, but...

15
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:41,804
Please, Sui.

16
00:00:43,864 --> 00:00:46,934
B-But it's embarrassing.

17
00:00:51,604 --> 00:00:53,344
Sorry.

18
00:00:55,704 --> 00:00:58,894
The way you get embarrassed, Sui...

19
00:01:00,334 --> 00:01:02,274
I think I'm into it.

20
00:01:04,904 --> 00:01:06,234
Huh?

21
00:01:28,654 --> 00:01:30,734
I'm sorry.

22
00:01:30,734 --> 00:01:32,574
I got carried away.

23
00:01:34,474 --> 00:01:36,234
I'm gonna wash up.

24
00:02:07,234 --> 00:02:09,764
What was that?

25
00:02:16,484 --> 00:02:19,464
I couldn't sleep at all.

26
00:02:25,684 --> 00:02:28,024
M-Morning.

27
00:02:29,710 --> 00:02:33,134
Good morning, Sui. Bye then.

28
00:02:40,284 --> 00:02:44,954
A dream? No, that definitely happened.

29
00:02:47,501 --> 00:02:49,261
Sui.

30
00:03:06,724 --> 00:03:08,244
Sui.

31
00:03:09,034 --> 00:03:11,104
I cleaned our room.

32
00:03:21,814 --> 00:03:25,654
He must've just gotten
caught up in the moment.

33
00:03:25,654 --> 00:03:29,264
Harutora's his usual self.

34
00:03:33,204 --> 00:03:38,024
<i>The way you get embarrassed, Sui...
I think I'm into it.</i>

35
00:03:43,644 --> 00:03:46,884
Sui, did you take a bath?

36
00:03:52,794 --> 00:03:54,604
S-Sorry.

37
00:03:54,604 --> 00:03:58,254
No, I'm actually... lucky.

38
00:04:05,343 --> 00:04:07,544
My bad.

39
00:04:07,544 --> 00:04:11,944
I meant I'm glad you didn't get hurt.

40
00:04:14,474 --> 00:04:18,284
What a shock.
I thought you felt the same as me.

41
00:04:19,204 --> 00:04:20,294
Huh?

42
00:04:20,294 --> 00:04:24,844
No, nothing. Nothing at all.

43
00:04:25,664 --> 00:04:27,984
Oh, right. Sui.

44
00:04:27,984 --> 00:04:30,574
Why don't you go to the big bath?

45
00:04:30,574 --> 00:04:33,984
Huh? That'd be awkward.

46
00:04:33,984 --> 00:04:36,584
Everyone knows I'm gay.

47
00:04:36,584 --> 00:04:40,344
Oh, so that's why...

48
00:04:45,116 --> 00:04:48,784
Then in that case...

49
00:04:48,784 --> 00:04:50,794
How about a tub in the room?

50
00:04:50,794 --> 00:04:52,304
Huh?

51
00:04:55,804 --> 00:04:57,414
An open-air bath.

52
00:04:57,414 --> 00:04:58,884
H-Huh?

53
00:04:58,884 --> 00:05:00,514
Or maybe...

54
00:05:01,704 --> 00:05:03,564
a Goemon bath.

55
00:05:10,874 --> 00:05:16,884
I think that side of you
is really charming, Harutora.

56
00:05:16,884 --> 00:05:18,194
Huh?

57
00:05:18,984 --> 00:05:22,474
You're serious, kind...

58
00:05:23,294 --> 00:05:25,554
and a tiny bit quirky.

59
00:06:30,884 --> 00:06:32,144
Yeah!

60
00:06:32,144 --> 00:06:35,912
Harutora. Let's take a break.

61
00:06:35,912 --> 00:06:37,334
Okay.

62
00:06:38,284 --> 00:06:43,244
Wait, Sui. Isn't it tough for you
to keep coming to my solo practices?

63
00:06:43,244 --> 00:06:45,384
Not at all. I enjoy it.

64
00:06:45,384 --> 00:06:48,754
Besides, if I'm not here,
you'll push yourself too hard.

65
00:06:48,754 --> 00:06:50,874
Oops, maybe I'm overstepping.

66
00:06:50,874 --> 00:06:53,254
No, I'm happy you care.

67
00:06:59,184 --> 00:07:01,844
Excuse me.

68
00:07:01,844 --> 00:07:05,034
- Yes?
- Can you call that person over for us?

69
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:15,714
Sure. I'll go get him.

70
00:07:19,304 --> 00:07:22,384
Those girls said they want to talk to you.

71
00:07:28,964 --> 00:07:30,734
Why?

72
00:07:32,904 --> 00:07:34,634
They want to get to know you.

73
00:07:34,634 --> 00:07:36,264
No, not that.

74
00:07:36,264 --> 00:07:37,388
Huh?

75
00:07:41,274 --> 00:07:42,701
Harutora?

76
00:07:47,574 --> 00:07:51,844
It hurts when you say things like that.

77
00:07:52,604 --> 00:07:54,434
It really hurts.

78
00:08:07,074 --> 00:08:09,684
Could we exchange numbers?

79
00:08:09,684 --> 00:08:13,044
Sorry, I can't.

80
00:08:14,344 --> 00:08:15,704
Huh?

81
00:08:16,914 --> 00:08:19,914
What did he mean just now?

82
00:08:25,284 --> 00:08:28,254
No way. My heart is...

83
00:08:32,074 --> 00:08:33,794
Sui.

84
00:08:33,794 --> 00:08:35,344
Dai-chan.

85
00:08:36,284 --> 00:08:38,164
Something wrong with your chest?

86
00:08:38,164 --> 00:08:40,514
Just heart palpitations...

87
00:08:40,514 --> 00:08:42,454
You're like an old man.

88
00:08:43,464 --> 00:08:48,794
Hey, so I saw you
hugging that newbie earlier.

89
00:08:50,854 --> 00:08:52,494
You okay?

90
00:08:53,444 --> 00:08:57,604
Remember when someone led you on
to make fun of you?

91
00:09:03,634 --> 00:09:06,504
What? You actually fell for it?

92
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:08,194
Did you want a kiss?

93
00:09:08,194 --> 00:09:09,894
Of course not.

94
00:09:09,894 --> 00:09:13,324
There's no way anyone would like me.

95
00:09:15,184 --> 00:09:17,944
Harutora's not that kind of guy.

96
00:09:18,774 --> 00:09:20,414
H-He wouldn't do that.

97
00:09:20,414 --> 00:09:23,444
O-Oh, right. That's true. Sorry.

98
00:09:23,444 --> 00:09:24,894
I'm sure you're right,

99
00:09:24,894 --> 00:09:29,634
but I think you should be careful
to avoid any misunderstandings.

100
00:09:30,584 --> 00:09:34,204
Yeah, I know. I get it.

101
00:09:35,944 --> 00:09:38,874
He just caught me because I stumbled.

102
00:09:38,874 --> 00:09:40,858
I see.

103
00:09:40,858 --> 00:09:42,944
That's good, then.

104
00:10:27,854 --> 00:10:30,684
Sui, welcome back.

105
00:10:32,195 --> 00:10:34,854
Sorry, did I wake you?

106
00:10:34,854 --> 00:10:37,744
No, I was awake.

107
00:10:37,744 --> 00:10:40,014
You're back late, huh?

108
00:10:41,184 --> 00:10:43,274
Yeah, I was out studying.

109
00:10:47,494 --> 00:10:51,084
If you're free this Sunday,

110
00:10:51,924 --> 00:10:53,714
wanna go here?

111
00:10:58,034 --> 00:11:00,868
[Relax your body and mind.]
It's a foot bath,

112
00:11:00,868 --> 00:11:03,514
[A prime seat overlooking the sacred peak.]
and the view is amazing.

113
00:11:03,514 --> 00:11:09,354
I thought you could relax there
without worrying about other people.

114
00:11:11,464 --> 00:11:15,164
Harutora, you looked this up for me?

115
00:11:16,647 --> 00:11:18,641
But you're so busy.

116
00:11:21,814 --> 00:11:26,614
<i>I think you should be careful
to avoid any misunderstandings.</i>

117
00:11:32,134 --> 00:11:34,882
Sorry. I think I'll pass.

118
00:11:35,869 --> 00:11:37,484
Did I say something weird again?

119
00:11:37,484 --> 00:11:40,514
No, it's because I have a test next week.

120
00:11:41,707 --> 00:11:44,084
- So that's why you were studying.
- Yeah.

121
00:11:45,334 --> 00:11:47,384
Got it.

122
00:11:47,384 --> 00:11:49,004
Good night.

123
00:12:16,484 --> 00:12:18,404
It's so pretty...

124
00:12:36,327 --> 00:12:38,167
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.

125
00:12:50,284 --> 00:12:52,584
He's still not back yet.

126
00:12:57,364 --> 00:13:01,026
[Sui Kishida - Harutora Kurobe]

127
00:13:17,064 --> 00:13:18,654
Wow.

128
00:13:33,884 --> 00:13:36,273
What are you doing, Sui?

129
00:13:37,014 --> 00:13:38,532
Dai-chan.

130
00:13:39,306 --> 00:13:41,334
You're on the committee too?

131
00:13:41,334 --> 00:13:44,713
It's rough staying so late, huh?

132
00:13:46,609 --> 00:13:48,304
It's not that...

133
00:13:52,734 --> 00:13:54,054
Huh?

134
00:13:56,714 --> 00:13:58,144
Seriously?

135
00:14:07,134 --> 00:14:08,384
Hey.

136
00:14:09,214 --> 00:14:12,754
Let's go over there. No one's around.

137
00:14:15,274 --> 00:14:16,884
Come on.

138
00:14:16,884 --> 00:14:18,774
I'll help you out.

139
00:14:20,034 --> 00:14:22,424
You don't look like you mind.

140
00:14:25,974 --> 00:14:27,304
Okay?

141
00:14:32,974 --> 00:14:37,696
A smile doesn't always mean someone likes it.

142
00:14:38,534 --> 00:14:41,424
Don't be rude to Sui.

143
00:14:43,884 --> 00:14:49,864
W-Whoa. I was just kidding! It was a joke.

144
00:14:54,755 --> 00:14:57,094
Sui, are you okay?

145
00:14:57,094 --> 00:15:00,534
Y-Yeah. Thanks for defending me.

146
00:15:00,534 --> 00:15:01,794
I'm totally fine.

147
00:15:01,794 --> 00:15:05,076
He was just messing around.

148
00:15:05,076 --> 00:15:08,274
But maybe he woke something inside of me.

149
00:15:08,274 --> 00:15:11,534
Being pushed around wasn't bad.

150
00:15:16,954 --> 00:15:18,794
Okay, then.

151
00:15:25,214 --> 00:15:26,714
Harutora?

152
00:15:32,034 --> 00:15:33,404
Huh?

153
00:15:40,362 --> 00:15:41,732
Huh?

154
00:15:53,124 --> 00:15:56,654
N-No... stop.

155
00:15:56,654 --> 00:15:58,774
I won't.

156
00:15:59,394 --> 00:16:02,154
Sui, this is what you want, right?

157
00:16:10,734 --> 00:16:12,954
No... No.

158
00:16:12,954 --> 00:16:16,297
Stop. Stop it, Harutora.

159
00:16:20,334 --> 00:16:23,084
Then tell him that too.

160
00:16:23,084 --> 00:16:25,354
Say no when you mean no.

161
00:16:34,724 --> 00:16:36,824
S-Sui...

162
00:16:41,294 --> 00:16:43,454
I'm sorry.

163
00:16:51,864 --> 00:16:53,734
I like you.

164
00:16:59,094 --> 00:17:02,314
I... I like you.

165
00:17:02,314 --> 00:17:05,264
I like you, Harutora.

166
00:17:13,536 --> 00:17:16,676
So don't do things like this.

167
00:17:17,514 --> 00:17:23,184
S-So stop being impulsive
and acting just on a whim.

168
00:17:24,494 --> 00:17:29,514
I've had enough of feeling miserable.

169
00:17:47,834 --> 00:17:50,094
- Here!
- I'm open!

170
00:17:50,094 --> 00:17:51,894
Sorry!

171
00:17:54,564 --> 00:17:56,084
Sui, I'm tired. Switch with me.

172
00:17:56,084 --> 00:17:58,104
Y-Yeah, sure.

173
00:18:04,694 --> 00:18:06,274
Let's go.

174
00:18:08,794 --> 00:18:10,754
You can do it!

175
00:18:20,384 --> 00:18:23,124
W-Wait! Oh, this isn't good.

176
00:18:23,124 --> 00:18:24,924
Nice one!

177
00:18:25,844 --> 00:18:27,554
Hurry! Faster!

178
00:18:31,394 --> 00:18:32,924
Harutora.

179
00:18:34,994 --> 00:18:37,764
<i>Then tell him that too.</i>

180
00:18:37,764 --> 00:18:40,044
<i>Say no when you mean no.</i>

181
00:18:51,344 --> 00:18:52,744
Sui.

182
00:18:52,744 --> 00:18:54,214
Over here.

183
00:18:54,214 --> 00:18:55,724
Okay.

184
00:19:15,444 --> 00:19:16,434
Nice!

185
00:19:16,434 --> 00:19:19,164
Dang it, are you serious?

186
00:19:38,904 --> 00:19:41,234
What...

187
00:19:41,234 --> 00:19:42,964
am I doing?

188
00:20:01,944 --> 00:20:05,124
Wait, Harutora?

189
00:20:08,184 --> 00:20:09,704
Sui.

190
00:20:10,774 --> 00:20:12,744
I'm sorry.

191
00:20:12,744 --> 00:20:14,004
Huh?

192
00:20:16,954 --> 00:20:18,434
I've...

193
00:20:20,604 --> 00:20:25,004
I've never really understood my own feelings.

194
00:20:26,844 --> 00:20:29,034
But I finally realized it.

195
00:20:33,544 --> 00:20:35,004
I...

196
00:20:37,914 --> 00:20:40,194
I like you, Sui.

197
00:20:41,114 --> 00:20:44,714
I like you. That's why I did that.

198
00:20:50,804 --> 00:20:52,394
I'm sorry...

199
00:20:53,524 --> 00:20:56,244
for hurting you.

200
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:06,974
Really?

201
00:21:08,134 --> 00:21:09,414
Huh?

202
00:21:10,824 --> 00:21:14,194
Are you really going to be my boyfriend?

203
00:21:17,264 --> 00:21:19,064
Really?

204
00:21:26,104 --> 00:21:27,954
Of course I will.

205
00:22:14,274 --> 00:22:17,504
Your heartbeat is so calming...

206
00:23:45,404 --> 00:23:46,904
I can't take this anymore.

207
00:23:46,904 --> 00:23:48,134
Am I right?

208
00:23:48,134 --> 00:23:50,014
I told you, you're wrong.

209
00:23:50,014 --> 00:23:52,834
I hate it when people mess with you.

210
00:23:52,834 --> 00:23:55,324
Because you said you like me.

211
00:23:55,324 --> 00:23:59,823
I'll always be by your side.

